  "content": "[![](https://i.imgur.com/jocYHF0.png)](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/stained-glass-ultra)   ![](https://i.imgur.com/PZduvU9.png)   [![](https://i.imgur.com/qPdqhzs.png)](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/create-ultra-pbr)\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vbi9D6z.jpg\" alt=\"金屬超清材質\" width=\"1200\" height=\"394\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #808080;\"><strong>此材質包為 Minecraft 的金屬材質提供手工製作的 PBR & POM 紋理，並持續擴增對各類閃亮模組金屬的支援！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>目前支援的模組：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>- </strong><strong><a style=\"color: #ffcc00;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/oxidized\"><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">氧化模組</span></a></strong></span><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #999999;\"> (所有方塊及銅傀儡)<br /></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/charm\">魅力模組</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #999999;\">(切割鐵、風化與氧化鐵塊及金塊)</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-weathering\">沉浸式風化</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #999999;\">(切割鐵、鐵板、鐵門、鐵活板門及鐵欄杆)</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/decorative-blocks\">裝飾方塊</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #999999;\">(欄杆面板、火盆、大型鎖鏈)</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-hopper\">黃金漏斗</a>&nbsp;</p>\n  \n<p><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/trash-cans\">垃圾桶</a>&nbsp;</p>\n\n  \n<p><span style=\"color: #808080;\"><strong>金屬超清材質專為 <a style=\"color: #808080;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/shader/complementary-reimagined\">Complementary Reimagined</a> 光影打造，但任何支援 labPBR 格式的光影皆可運作。</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #f0f;\"><span style=\"color: #c9f;\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">相容於自 1.8 版起的所有 Minecraft 版本，「不相容」警告可安全忽略。請務必將此材質包置於所有其他會修改本包涵蓋方塊的資源包之上！請注意，本材質包僅為光影支援添加紋理，若未使用光影則無任何效果！</span><br /></span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hwavd0i.png\" alt=\"金屬超清材質\" width=\"1120\" height=\"388\" /></p>",
